{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "68f7b64f-2d95-4d84-9746-07137a44cb9e",
    "name": "GatewayX — Local API Collection",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Implemented APIs only. Import the accompanying environment, select GatewayX Local, and run the session walkthrough in order. Postman handles session cookies automatically. Both gateways must use the same hostname (localhost) because cookies are host-scoped, not port-scoped. No Bearer token or API key is required. The first request generates unique demo emails when blank. Real rate limits apply: wait Retry-After if you receive 429. Direct backend folders bypass gateway sessions, rate limits and circuit breakers. Review Service must be running on 3103. No product/review create/update/delete endpoints exist yet."
  },
